00:02:26.920 --> 00:02:28.340
Nonsense. Magnemite's job

00:02:28.340 --> 00:02:29.860
is to send power where we save.

00:02:30.060 --> 00:02:30.940
Now give it the order.

00:03:02.400 --> 00:03:10.740
very same move I made. Come on, Tobio. Wake off. I see you now. I'm coming toward you.

00:03:17.880 --> 00:03:29.980
Don't hit Sigurus. Get back to your posts now. We've come too close to be...

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:32.960
Stopped by a loose cable.

00:04:27.640 --> 00:04:29.790
This is your new life I

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:31.360
