00:05:14.980 --> 00:05:17.790
Gentlemen, I'd like you to meet Astro,

00:05:18.220 --> 00:05:21.900
the most evolved robot science has ever created.

00:05:23.020 --> 00:05:25.580
You're kidding, right? It looks like a child.

00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:27.720
