00:05:28.360 --> 00:05:29.780
Don't let his look fool you.

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:31.580
He's learning at an exponential rate,

00:05:31.600 --> 00:05:34.340
and he has Kokoro, his own thoughts and spirit.

00:05:34.580 --> 00:05:35.180
Right.

00:05:36.010 --> 00:05:38.590
Corliss Windows learned something useful.

00:05:38.710 --> 00:05:39.830
