00:05:41.770 --> 00:05:42.270
Wait!

00:05:42.610 --> 00:05:43.990
Think of the future!

00:05:44.410 --> 00:05:46.830
Well, Andy, there's a clearing.

00:05:49.490 --> 00:05:50.770
